        {
            "color": "blue",
            "data": {
                "text": "## 1. Inputs\n\nSupply assemblies and quality-trimmed, host-removed paired-end reads in the same order. Every binner is enabled by default: select **No** to skip one. Choose the refinement tool and the Binette settings."
            },
            "id": 1,
            "position": [
                30,
                35
            ],
            "size": [
                400,
                260
            ],
            "type": "markdown"
        },
        {
            "color": "turquoise",
            "data": {
                "text": "## 2. Coverage\n\nBowtie2 maps each sample's reads against its own assembly and Samtools sorts the alignments. Contig depths and CONCOCT fragment coverage summarise them, and the CONCOCT read length is estimated from both mates."
            },
            "id": 3,
            "position": [
                630,
                35
            ],
            "size": [
                900,
                260
            ],
            "type": "markdown"
        },
        {
            "color": "lime",
            "data": {
                "text": "## 3. Binning\n\nEach enabled binner clusters contigs into candidate bins from the contig depths and sequence composition. CONCOCT works on fragments with its own coverage table and merges them back to contigs. Disabled binners are bridged with empty collections so the downstream steps keep their structure."
            },
            "id": 5,
            "position": [
                2540,
                35
            ],
            "size": [
                1100,
                260
            ],
            "type": "markdown"
        },
        {
            "color": "orange",
            "data": {
                "text": "## 4. Refinement\n\nCandidate contig assignments are collected for DAS Tool and candidate FASTA bins for Binette. Only the selected refinement tool runs. The refined bins are returned with their quality reports and coverage matrices."
            },
            "id": 7,
            "position": [
                5290,
                35
            ],
            "size": [
                400,
                260
            ],
            "type": "markdown"
